		shaders_no_panel = "This effect has no settings panel.",
		shaders_panel_error = "The effect's settings panel failed to build: %s",
		shaders_folder_note = "Shader folder: %s\nPut a downloaded shader pack there as a folder (from the Workshop or GitHub) with materials/ and shaders/fxc/ inside, or just loose .vmt and .vcs files, then press Rescan — the pack is mounted without restarting the game. Its shaders appear in the Render window: Camera effects → Custom shader. Lua from a pack is not run: an addon with Lua (hook-based effects, GShader Library itself) is installed the usual way — a Workshop subscription or a folder in garrysmod/addons — and works through Engine frame.",
